WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.801
-Mikey!
Thank you for being here.

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:05.133
Your new show "Is It Cake?"
is incredible. I love it.

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:07.000
-That means a lot, man.
Thanks for watching.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.501
-I'm like, is it cake
or isn't it?

00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:10.667
I mean, the one with the burger
really got me, by the way.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:11.701
Uh -- oh.

00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:12.934
Do you have a twin brother?

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:15.734
-No, that's the cake version
of me.

00:00:15.734 --> 00:00:17.400
[ Piano key strikes ]

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.400
The bakers we have on the show
are really talented.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.901
You want to taste it?

00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:25.133
-Y-You want me to eat
the cake version of you?

00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:27.133
-Yeah. It's delicious.

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:28.968
His skin is
cream cheese frosting.

00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:30.300
[ Metal scrapes ]

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.133
-Hey! What are you doing, man?

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:37.834
I'm not cake! He is!
[ Dramatic sting ]

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:40.501
-No, he's lying.
I'm the real Mikey Day.

00:00:40.501 --> 00:00:42.467
-No, I am!

00:00:42.467 --> 00:00:45.300
-I am!
-No, I am!

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.300
-Jimmy, eat him.
He tastes so good.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.934
-No, eat him!
He's absolutely delectable!

00:00:51.934 --> 00:00:54.234
-How are you both talking
if one of you is cake?

00:00:54.234 --> 00:00:56.434
-The bakers are really,
really talented.

00:00:56.434 --> 00:00:57.901
-Right? So talented.

00:00:57.901 --> 00:00:59.567
-Just so, so talented.

00:00:59.567 --> 00:01:01.267
-Alright, alright!
Enough! Enough!

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:03.434
I just gotta go for it.

00:01:03.434 --> 00:01:04.501
[ Squish ]

00:01:04.501 --> 00:01:06.000
-Why would you do this?!

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.167
I'm a guest on your show,
you monster!

00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:10.667
-Mikey, I'm so sorry!

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:12.334
I-I-- What have I done?!

00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:13.501
-Nah, I'm kidding.

00:01:13.501 --> 00:01:14.834
I'm cake.
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:14.834 --> 00:01:15.801
Mmm!

